{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>爆紅日本FamilyMart神級杯麵！</h2>\n<p>日本全家（FamilyMart）獨家發售的「清爽檸檬帆立貝」杯麵，近日在 Threads 上掀起熱討，被網民譽為「神仙級」宵夜美食。 這款杯麵主打清爽檸檬風味與滿滿小帆立貝，口感清新不油膩。網民在 分享在日本全家便利店購入，一吃驚為天人，大讚「口感有夠清爽」，杯麵內放滿真材實料的小帆立貝。\n</p>\n<h2>清爽檸檬兼滿滿帆立貝</h2>\n<p>湯頭帶有檸檬的微微酸香，完美平衡了海鮮湯底的濃郁感，即使是深夜當宵夜享用亦不會覺得負擔過重。 這款熱門杯麵目前主要在日本全家便利店獨家販售，但有網民留言提到該品項相當搶手，甚至逛了幾十家便利店都未見蹤影。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179303050095434601_1379911796adf7965d48c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179303050095434601_1379911796adf7965d48c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930305035022915_18295318206adf79680eb0b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930305035022915_18295318206adf79680eb0b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179303050549835257_16428313766adf796a071a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179303050549835257_16428313766adf796a071a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De9dGeEE6Ai/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.573025+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:19:10.338065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:26.305164+00:00","content_hash":"2229f5a56f18d7b59f42706ab7ce7c6a3ba08bd473c48d0806ce55b5e75e5b93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}